# Build outputs — regenerated deterministically by build.sh (same bytes as
# Part 2/3/4; sha256 eff7f5ee…). Never committed.
app.wasm

# ch20/ch21 interposed compositions + the ambassador resilience artifact,
# regenerated by the component build.sh scripts (wac plug recompose). Never
# committed. Cargo.lock for the sidecar-filter / adapter cargo-component crates
# IS committed (reproducible builds) — only the *.wasm outputs are ignored.
sidecar-filter/app-filtered.wasm
adapter/app-adapted.wasm
ambassador/ambassador.wasm

# Rust/cargo-component build trees for the new interposer crates.
*/target/
**/target/

# Any stray local tarball of the shim if a script leaves it behind (install-shim.sh
# downloads to a temp dir, but belt-and-braces).
*.tar.gz
containerd-shim-wasmtime-v1
